      "q": "Which agencies buy from Viasat?",
      "a": "The Department of Defense buys the most from Viasat, obligating $213M. The General Services Administration follows with $119M, and smaller buyers include the Department of Homeland Security at $1.4M and the National Aeronautics and Space Administration at $346K."
