    {
      "q": "What does Viasat sell to the government?",
      "a": "Viasat sells communications and space-related products and services, as reflected by market obligations such as Other Communications Equipment Manufacturing at $190M and Guided Missile and Space Vehicle Manufacturing at $75M. Viasat also has work in Radio and Television Broadcasting and Wireless Communications Equipment Manufacturing at $29.5M, Satellite Telecommunications at $15.5M, and Research and Development in the Physical, Engineering, and Life Sciences at $12.6M."
